            "values": [
                {
                    "key": "message",
                    "value": "Adjustable Round Glasses\nBy Cobold The Fox!\nThanks for supporting me!\n\n\nTo Adjust The Glasses Parameters, change the Parameter values, then right click the Hotkey Node and select \"Send Signal\".\n\nParameters:\n\tGlassesLensSize \n\t\t0 to 1\n\t\tAffects the size of the Lens.\n\n\tGlassesArmLength\n\t\t0 to 1\n\t\tAffects the length of the arms.\n\t\n\tGlassesArmRotation\n\t\t-1 to 1\n\t\tAffects the arms position, can be shut or open wider.\n\t\n\tGlassesWidth\n\t\t0 to 1\n\t\tAffects the spacing between the lenses."
                }
            ],
